			subtitle: "&e黄金地牢&r位于球状浮空岛上,地表生长着大量&e金橡树&f&r.这类地牢通常仅包含&c首领房间&r,没有前置的宝藏/怪物房间.&e烈阳巨灵&f&r无法直接攻击致死,必须将其投掷的&f白色物体&r多次反弹回击才能消灭.每次反弹成功会分裂出小型分身攻击玩家.击败&e烈阳巨灵&f&r后,天境世界才会首次迎来日落——在此之前太阳永不西沉.&7[Gold Dungeons are located within spherical islands with lots of Golden Oak trees growing on top of them. This dungeon normally will only have the lboss room in it, with no treasure/mob rooms beforehand. The Sun Spirit cannot be killed by attacking it directly and must be killed by hitting the white object he throws back at it multiple times. Every time it is hit with the white object, it sends out a smaller version of itself to attack the player. Once the player kills the Sun Spirit, the sun will finally set in the Aether. Before the player kills the Sun Spirit, the sun will never go down.]&f"
